  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc02_0370_bbteacher_01",
      "hash64": "43953386D8BF9EF9",
      "text": "Ah, [VAR 0x0100(0000)] !\\nJe suis contente de te voir ![VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc02_0370_bbteacher_02",
      "hash64": "43953086D8BF99E0",
      "text": "Alors, tu t’es bien remis[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e de nos aventures\\ndans l’Abîme Zéro ?[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc02_0370_bbteacher_03",
      "hash64": "43953186D8BF9B93",
      "text": "Ah, c’est beau, la jeunesse !\\c\\nDire que moi, j’ai encore des courbatures, alors\\nque nous sommes rentrés il y a plusieurs jours...[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 131,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc02_0370_bbteacher_04",
      "hash64": "43953686D8BFA412",
      "text": "Tiens ?! Voilà qui est peu banal vu ton âge !\\c\\nAurais-tu perdu ton endurance, à force de\\ntoujours monter sur [VAR 0x1107(00FF,0202)]KoMiraidon ?[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 111,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1107",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0202"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 128,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc02_0370_bbteacher_05",
      "hash64": "43953786D8BFA5C5",
      "text": "En tout cas, j’ai passé toutes mes nuits à mettre\\npar écrit nos découvertes dans l’Abîme Zéro !\\r\\nJ’ai d’ailleurs décidé de les faire publier.[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 143,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc02_0370_bbteacher_06",
      "hash64": "43953486D8BFA0AC",
      "text": "Il va sans dire que j’ai demandé l’autorisation de\\nmadame Alisma, et que j’ai omis certains détails.\\c\\nEt rassure-toi, j’ai aussi préservé l’anonymat\\ndes membres de notre expédition.[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 183,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc02_0370_bbteacher_07",
      "hash64": "43953586D8BFA25F",
      "text": "Voici d’ailleurs un exemplaire de mon livre,\\nfraîchement arrivé de ma maison d’édition ![VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc02_0370_bbteacher_08",
      "hash64": "43953A86D8BFAADE",
      "text": "Je tenais particulièrement à ce que tu reçoives\\nun exemplaire. Sans toi, je ne sais pas ce que\\r\\nnous aurions fait...[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 118,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc02_0370_bbteacher_09",
      "hash64": "43953B86D8BFAC91",
      "text": "C’est aussi ma façon de te présenter mes excuses\\npour avoir été aussi irresponsable dans l’abîme...[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc02_0370_bbteacher_10",
      "hash64": "4398B886D8C2B6CF",
      "text": "D’ailleurs, je souhaitais également te parler\\nd’autre chose.\\c\\nPourrais-tu me montrer ton Orbe Téracristal ?[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 109,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc02_0370_bbteacher_11",
      "hash64": "4398B786D8C2B51C",
      "text": "Je m’en doutais... Ton orbe agit de la même\\nfaçon que ceux de Kassis et Roseille ![VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc02_0370_bbteacher_12",
      "hash64": "4398BA86D8C2BA35",
      "text": "C’est peut-être dû à leur exposition directe\\nà l’énergie de Terapagos dans l’Abîme Zéro...[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc02_0370_bbteacher_13",
      "hash64": "4398B986D8C2B882",
      "text": "Selon leurs dires, depuis l’expédition, leurs orbes\\nn’ont désormais plus besoin d’être rechargés\\r\\nentre deux utilisations.[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 124,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc02_0370_bbteacher_14",
      "hash64": "4398B486D8C2B003",
      "text": "Et tant qu’on parle de l’Abîme Zéro, j’ai encore\\nune information à te transmettre ![VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc02_0370_bbteacher_15",
      "hash64": "4398B386D8C2AE50",
      "text": "Au sujet du Terra-Noyau. Tu sais, le dispositif\\nsuspendu au plafond du Terra-Dôme ![VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc02_0370_bbteacher_16",
      "hash64": "4398B686D8C2B369",
      "text": "Jusqu’à maintenant, je le réapprovisionnais\\nparfois avec de la terre venant de Paldea,\\r\\net avec de l’eau du Lac Cristallin...[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 127,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc02_0370_bbteacher_17",
      "hash64": "4398B586D8C2B1B6",
      "text": "C’est ce mélange qui permet de déclencher de\\nfaçon stable la Téracristallisation dans l’enceinte\\r\\nde l’institut.[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 114,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc02_0370_bbteacher_18",
      "hash64": "4398C086D8C2C467",
      "text": "Mais l’autre jour, j’ai eu l’idée d’y introduire\\ndes cristaux prélevés dans l’Abîme Zéro,\\r\\nce qui a altéré les propriétés du noyau.[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 133,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc02_0370_bbteacher_19",
      "hash64": "4398BF86D8C2C2B4",
      "text": "Depuis, des Pokémon de type Téracristal\\nStellaire ont été aperçus sous le Terra-Dôme.\\r\\nLeur éclat rappelle les couleurs de l’arc-en-ciel ![VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 140,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc02_0370_bbteacher_20",
      "hash64": "438E4686D8B9A094",
      "text": "Nous allons pouvoir les étudier et ainsi faire\\nde prodigieuses avancées dans le domaine\\r\\nde la Téracristallisation. Ce sera éblouissant ![VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 139,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc02_0370_bbteacher_23",
      "hash64": "438E4986D8B9A5AD",
      "text": "Ah ! Tant que j’y pense... Il semblerait qu’un\\nhomme portant un costume noir demande\\r\\nà te rencontrer à l’entrée de l’institut ![VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 130,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc02_0370_bbteacher_21",
      "hash64": "438E4786D8B9A247",
      "text": "Voilà, c’est tout ce que je voulais te dire.\\nMerci de m’avoir accordé un peu de ton temps ![VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc02_0370_bbteacher_22",
      "hash64": "438E4886D8B9A3FA",
      "text": "J’ai justement rendez-vous avec ma maison\\nd’édition... Je dois te laisser.\\c\\nJ’espère que tu me laisseras observer Terapagos\\nde plus près, à l’occasion ! À très vite ![VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 168,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
